# 🧪 Test, Match & Replace

### 🎯 Live Match Highlighting

🔦 See which sections of the test text are matched as the pattern is refined.

### 🧷 Capture Groups

📌 Inspect captured sections and understand how groups interact with the complete expression.

### 🔄 Replacement Builder

🛠️ Construct replacement patterns using visual blocks instead of memorizing every back-reference format.

